  "setupTimeout": "Shizuku kama jawaabin 2 daqiiqo gudahood. Fur Shizuku, hubi inay leedahay way shaqaynaysaa, kadibna mar kale taabo badhanka. Haddii habayntu goor dambe dhammaato, shaashaddan iskeed ayay isu cusbooneysiinaysaa.",
