  "settingSilenceBody": "Waa lagu talinayaa. Barnaamijyada qaarkood ma oggola in codkooda la shaandheeyo; tani way aamusiisaa halkii muusiggu ka gudbi lahaa.",
  "settingHoldSilenceTitle": "Barnaamijyada aamusan ku hay haddii shaandhayntu iskeed u joogsato",
  "settingHoldSilenceBody": "Waa lagu talinayaa. Haddii Android ay joojiso shaandhaynta (adiga ma aha), barnaamijyada kale way aamusnaanayaan ilaa aad dib u bilowdo ama aad taabato Jooji, halkii ay muusig aan la shaandheyn daari lahaayeen. Waxay u baahan tahay habaynta hal mar ah.",
  "settingStereoTitle": "Cod stereo ah",
  "settingStereoBody": "Damsan: mono, oo isticmaala qiyaastii kala badh batariga, kuna socda taleefanno badan. Daaran: wuxuu kala ilaaliyaa dhinaca bidix iyo midig. Haddii taleefanku aad ugu gaabis yahay stereo, iskiis ayuu ugu wareegaa mono.",
