  "blurTitle": "Qarinta shaashadda",
  "blurBody": "Waxay daboolaysaa dadka iyo sawirrada shaashadda, barnaamij kasta, inta shaandhayntu daaran tahay. Taleefanka ayay ka shaqaysaa; meelna waxba looma diro.",
  "blurWomenTitle": "Qari haweenka",
  "blurWomenBody": "Jirka oo dhan waa la daboolaa. Haddii barnaamijku uusan hubin in qofku nin yahay, isna waa la daboolaa.",
  "blurNudityTitle": "Qari sawirrada aan asturnayn",
  "blurNudityBody": "Qaawanaan ama dhar jirka muujiya, qof kasta ha ahaadee: shaashadda oo dhan waa la daboolaa.",
  "blurFailTitle": "Dabool shaashadda haddii qarintu aanay la jaanqaadi karin",
  "blurFailBody": "Daaran: shaashadda oo dhan waa la daboolaa marka taleefanku aad u gaabis yahay ama qarintu fashilanto. Damsan: shaashaddu way muuqanaysaa iyadoo digniin leh.",
  "blurSetupShizuku": "Ku ogolow Shizuku",
  "blurSetupManual": "Ku ogolow dejinta Android",
  "blurStatusNeedsSetup": "Si ay u qariso, Waaiya waa inay ka muuqataa barnaamijyada kale dushooda. Midda ugu fiican: “Ku ogolow Shizuku”, si taabashadaadu weli u gaarto barnaamijka ka hooseeya qarinta. Ama “Ku ogolow dejinta Android”, laakiin markaas taabashada meel la qariyay waxba ma qabato.",
  "blurStatusNeedsOverlay": "Si ay u qariso, Waaiya waa inay ka muuqataa barnaamijyada kale dushooda. Midda ugu fiican: bilow Shizuku oo Waaiya ku ogolow gudaheeda, si taabashadaadu weli u gaarto barnaamijka ka hooseeya qarinta. Ama ka ogolow “Display over other apps” dejinta Android, laakiin markaas taabashada meel la qariyay waxba ma qabato.",
  "blurFailUnavailable": "Hadda lama isticmaali karo: dabool shaashadda oo dhan ah wuxuu xannibi lahaa taabasho kasta, waadna ku xanibmi kartaa. Bilow caawiyaha Waaiya ama Shizuku (Android 12 ama ka cusub), doorashadanina way furmaysaa: daboollada markaas waxaa loo sawiraa si taabashadu uga gudubto. Ilaa markaas, marka qarintu aanay la jaanqaadi karin, shaashaddu way muuqanaysaa iyadoo digniin leh.",
  "blurFailNeedsA11y": "Hadda lama isticmaali karo: dabool shaashadda oo dhan ah wuxuu xannibi lahaa taabasho kasta, waadna ku xanibmi kartaa. Bilow Shizuku (Android 12 ama ka cusub) ama daar adeegga helitaanka (accessibility) ee “Qarinta Waaiya” (Ku ogolow Shizuku, kor), doorashadanina way furmaysaa. Ilaa markaas, shaashaddu way muuqanaysaa iyadoo digniin leh.",
