  "blurSetupFailed": "Shizuku ma ogolaan karin:\n{details}",
  "step2Guide": "Sida loo bilaabo Shizuku",
  "blurFailOldAndroid": "Lama isticmaali karo: noocan Android, dabool shaashadda oo dhan ah wuxuu xannibi lahaa taabasho kasta, waadna ku xanibmi kartaa (daboollada Shizuku waxay u baahan yihiin Android 12 ama ka cusub). Marka qarintu aanay la jaanqaadi karin, shaashaddu way muuqanaysaa iyadoo digniin leh.",
  "guideTitle": "Bilow Shizuku, tallaabo tallaabo",
  "guideOpenDev": "Fur “Developer options”",
  "guideOpenShizuku": "Fur Shizuku",
  "guideClose": "Xir",
  "guideBody": "Waxaad u baahan tahay Wi-Fi iyo Android 11 ama ka cusub. Isku xirka (pairing) hal mar ayaa la sameeyaa; marka taleefanka dib loo shido waxaad ku celinaysaa oo kaliya tallaabada 7.\n\n1. Taleefanka ku xir Wi-Fi.\n\n2. Daar doorashooyinka horumariyaha (“Developer options”): dejinta taleefanka (“Settings”) › “About phone” › “Software information” › taabo “Build number” 7 jeer. (Taleefannada kale: “Settings” › “About phone” › “Build number”.)\n\n3. Fur Shizuku. Haddii ay weydiiso inay muujiso ogeysiisyo, u ogolow: koodhka isku xirka waxaa lagu qoraa ogeysiis Shizuku.\n\n4. Shizuku gudaheeda, hoosta “Start via Wireless debugging”, taabo “Pairing”. Bogga furmaya, taabo “Developer options”, daar cilad-baadhista bilaa-siligga ah (“Wireless debugging”) oo ku xaqiiji “Allow”.\n\n5. Taabo erayada “Wireless debugging” (ma aha furaha daarista), kadibna “Pair device with pairing code”. Koodh 6 lambar ah ayaa soo baxaya.\n\n6. Shaashaddaas furan ku hay oo hoos u soo jiid ogeysiisyada. Marka ogeysiiska Shizuku uu yiraahdo “Pairing service found”, taabo “Enter pairing code” oo qor koodhka. Shizuku waxay sheegaysaa in isku xirku guuleystay.\n\n7. Ku noqo Shizuku oo taabo “Start” hoosta “Start via Wireless debugging”. Sug ilaa ay tiraahdo “Shizuku is running”.\n\n8. Ku soo noqo Waaiya oo taabo “Bixi ogolaansho”, kadibna “Allow”.\n\nMarka taleefanka dib loo shido, Shizuku way joogsataa: ku xir Wi-Fi, dib u daar “Wireless debugging” haddii uu damsan yahay, fur Shizuku oo taabo “Start”. Isku xir cusub looma baahna.",
  "wsetupRouteTitle": "Ku habee taleefankan",
  "wsetupRouteBody": "Afar tallaabo oo gaagaaban, hal mar la sameeyo. Barnaamij dheeraad ah iyo kombiyuutar midna looma baahna. Waaiya waxay calaamadisaa tallaabo kasta marka la dhammeeyo.",
  "wizDevTitle": "Daar doorashooyinka horumariyaha (“Developer options”)",
  "wizDevBody": "Gudaha macluumaadka taleefanka (“About phone”), taabo “Build number” 7 jeer, kadibna halkan ku soo noqo. Haddii aadan helin, ka raadi “Build number” gudaha dejinta taleefanka (“Settings”).",
  "wizDevBodySamsung": "Gudaha macluumaadka taleefanka (“About phone”) › “Software information”, taabo “Build number” 7 jeer, kadibna halkan ku soo noqo.",
  "wizDevBodyXiaomi": "Gudaha macluumaadka taleefanka (“About phone”), taabo “OS version” 7 jeer (taleefannada duqowga ah: “MIUI version”; qaarkood waxay ku hoos jirtaa “Detailed info and specs”), kadibna halkan ku soo noqo.",
  "wizDevBodyColoros": "Gudaha “About device” (ama “About phone”) › “Version”, taabo “Build number” 7 jeer, kadibna halkan ku soo noqo.",
  "wizDevBodyVivo": "Gudaha macluumaadka taleefanka (“About phone”), taabo “Software version” 7 jeer (taleefannada qaarkood: “Software information” › “Build number”), kadibna halkan ku soo noqo.",
  "wizDevBodyHuawei": "Gudaha macluumaadka taleefanka (“About phone”), taabo “Build number” 7 jeer, kadibna halkan ku soo noqo.",
  "wizDevBodyTranssion": "Gudaha “My phone” (ama “About phone”), taabo “Build number” 7 jeer, kadibna halkan ku soo noqo.",
  "setupNoteHuawei": "Huawei: taleefanno badan oo Huawei ah ma laha “Wireless debugging”. Haddii aadan ka helin “Developer options”, isticmaal kombiyuutar (“Habab kale” ee hoose).",
  "wsetupFilterOn": "Shaandhayntu way daaran tahay: noocan Android, koodhka laguma qori karo ogeysiis inta ay shaqaynayso. Marka hore jooji shaandhaynta, ama isticmaal shaashad qaybsan iyo “Koodhka halkan ku qor”.",
  "wizDevSearch": "Magacyadu way kala duwanaan karaan iyadoo ku xiran luqadda taleefanka: haddii aadan helin, isticmaal raadinta ku taal korka dejinta taleefanka (“Settings”).",
  "wizDevAction": "Fur “About phone”",
  "wizWifiTitle": "Ku xir Wi-Fi",
