  "wsetupDoneBody": "Waaiya hadda way aamusiin kartaa codka asalka ah. Waad demin kartaa “Wireless debugging”.",
  "wsetupDoneHelperBody": "Waa la dhammeeyay. Taleefankani uma oggola barnaamijyada inay haystaan ogolaanshahan, sidaas darteed caawiyaha Waaiya ayaa aamusiya codka asalka ah. Caawiyuhu wuu joogsadaa marka taleefanka dib loo shido iyo marka Waaiya la cusbooneysiiyo. Marka aad intaas kadib furto Waaiya, iskeed ayay dib u bilaabaysaa caawiyaha haddii “Wireless debugging” daaran yahay; haddii kale, waxay muujinaysaa badhan loogu talagalay.",
  "helperMissingTitle": "Caawiyaha Waaiya wuu joogsaday",
  "helperMissingBody": "Taleefankani ma hayo ogolaanshaha Waaiya, sidaas darteed Waaiya waxay isticmaashaa caawiyaheeda. Caawiyuhu wuu joogsadaa marka taleefanka dib loo shido iyo marka Waaiya la cusbooneysiiyo. Ku xir Wi-Fi, daar “Wireless debugging” gudaha doorashooyinka horumariyaha (“Developer options”), kadibna taabo “Bilow caawiyaha Waaiya”.",
  "helperChannel": "Caawiyaha Waaiya",
  "helperStarting": "Caawiyaha waa la bilaabayaa…",
  "helperModeNote": "Taleefankani uma oggola barnaamijyada inay haystaan ogolaanshahan: caawiyaha Waaiya ayaa shaqada qabta. Wuu joogsadaa marka taleefanka dib loo shido iyo marka Waaiya la cusbooneysiiyo. Marka aad intaas kadib furto Waaiya, iskeed ayay dib u bilaabaysaa caawiyaha haddii “Wireless debugging” daaran yahay; haddii kale, waxay muujinaysaa badhan loogu talagalay.",
  "helperTipXiaomi": "Ikhtiyaari, si ogolaanshaha weligood loo haysto (caawiye looma baahna marka dib loo shido): gudaha doorashooyinka horumariyaha (“Developer options”), daar “USB debugging (Security settings)” (waxay kaa codsanaysaa inaad gasho akoon Xiaomi), kadibna mar kale samee habaynta.",
  "helperTipColoros": "Ikhtiyaari, si ogolaanshaha weligood loo haysto (caawiye looma baahna marka dib loo shido): gudaha doorashooyinka horumariyaha (“Developer options”), daar “Disable permission monitoring” (noocyada ugu cusub: “Disable system optimization”; waxaa laga yaabaa inay muuqato oo kaliya marka luqadda taleefanku tahay Ingiriis), kadibna mar kale samee habaynta.",
  "stateOnHelperMissing": "Codka asalka ah lama aamusiin, sidaas darteed waxaad maqlaysaa muusigga oo la socda codka la shaandheeyay: caawiyaha Waaiya wuu joogsaday. Ku xir Wi-Fi, daar “Wireless debugging”, kadibna taabo “Bilow caawiyaha Waaiya”.",
  "setupRefusedTryWireless": "Ama isticmaal “Ku habee taleefankan” ee boggan: caawiyaha Waaiya markaas wuu shaqeeyaa iyadoo aan furahaas loo baahnayn.",
  "helperStartAnywayTitle": "Caawiyaha Waaiya wuu joogsaday",
  "helperStartAnywayBody": "La'aantiis waxaad maqli doontaa muusigga oo la socda codka la shaandheeyay. Marka hore bilow caawiyaha (“Wireless debugging” waa inuu daaran yahay), ama si kastaba u bilow shaandhaynta.",
  "wsetupFailedTitle": "Habayntu ma dhammaan",
  "wsetupPairing": "Waa la isku xirayaa…",
  "wsetupConnecting": "Waa la xirayaa, ogolaanshahana waa la bixinayaa…",
  "wsetupNeedWifi": "Marka hore ku xir shabakad Wi-Fi ah (internet looma baahna): “Wireless debugging” wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa oo kaliya Wi-Fi.",
  "wsetupNeedWirelessDebugging": "Gudaha doorashooyinka horumariyaha (“Developer options”), daar “Wireless debugging”, kadibna taabo magaciisa iyo “Pair device with pairing code”.",
  "wsetupOpenDialog": "Gudaha “Wireless debugging”, taabo “Pair device with pairing code”. Koodhka shaashadda ku hay oo halkan ka taabo “Geli koodhka”.",
  "wsetupEnterCodeBody": "Taabo “Geli koodhka” oo qor koodhka 6 lambar ah ee ka muuqda dejinta taleefanka (“Settings”).",
  "wsetupCodeWaiting": "Koodhka waa la helay. Waxaa la sugayaa shaashadda “Pair device with pairing code”: furan ku hay.",
  "wsetupWrongCode": "Koodhkaas lama aqbalin. Hubi 6-da lambar ee shaashadda oo mar kale geli. Haddii shaashadda isku xirku xirantay, mar kale fur: koodhku wuu isbeddelaa.",
  "wsetupPairingFailed": "Isku xirku ma shaqayn. Xir shaashadda isku xirka, mar kale fur “Pair device with pairing code” oo geli koodhka cusub.",
  "wsetupWaitingConnect": "Waa la isku xiray. “Wireless debugging” daaran ku hay: Waaiya waa ku xirmaysaa.",
  "wsetupNotPaired": "Taleefankani mar dambe ma yaqaan Waaiya (isku xirka waa la tirtiray ama wakhtigiisii wuu dhacay). Fur “Pair device with pairing code” oo geli koodhka.",
  "wsetupConnectFailed": "Laguma xirmi karin “Wireless debugging”. Dami oo dib u daar: Waaiya iskeed ayay mar kale isku dayaysaa.",
  "wsetupGrantFailed": "Waa la xiray, laakiin ogolaanshaha weli way maqan yihiin. Isticmaal Shizuku ama kombiyuutar, hoos.",
  "wsetupTimeout": "Waa la joojiyay 10 daqiiqo kadib iyadoo aan la dhammayn. Mar kale ayaad isku dayi kartaa.",
  "wsetupCodeUnreadable": "Qor 6-da lambar ee koodhka isku xirka.",
  "wsetupCodeHint": "Koodh 6 lambar ah",
  "wsetupEnterCode": "Geli koodhka",
  "wsetupDetail": "Faahfaahin: {details}",
  "wsetupErrTimeout": "jawaab lama helin waqtigii loogu talagalay",
  "wsetupErrRefused": "xiriirka waa la diiday",
  "wsetupDevOff": "Doorashooyinka horumariyaha (“Developer options”) way damsan yihiin. Gudaha “About phone”, taabo “Build number” 7 jeer, kadibna soo noqo.",
  "wsetupOpenAbout": "Fur “About phone”",
  "wsetupNotifOff": "Ogeysiisyada waa u damsan yihiin Waaiya, sidaas darteed koodhka laguma qori karo ogeysiis. Isticmaal shaashad qaybsan (“Settings” hal dhinac, Waaiya dhinaca kale) oo taabo “Koodhka halkan ku qor”.",
  "wsetupCodeDialogTitle": "Koodhka isku xirka",
  "wsetupCodeDialogBody": "Kaliya marka shaashaddu qaybsan tahay (“Settings” hal dhinac, Waaiya dhinaca kale): haddii aad ka baxdo “Settings” shaashadda isku xirka way xirantaa, koodhkeeduna ma shaqeeyo. Qor koodhka 6 lambar ah ee ka muuqda hoosta “Pair device with pairing code”.",
  "wsetupCodeOk": "Isku xir",
  "blurStrictTitle": "Yaa aan la daboolin",
  "blurStrictValue": "Yaa aan la daboolin: {level}",
  "blurStrict0": "Adag: kaliya dadka barnaamijku ku dhow yahay inuu hubo inay rag yihiin",
  "blurStrict1": "Dhexdhexaad: qiyaastii laba jeer rag ka badan oo aan la daboolin",
  "blurStrict2": "Fudud: rag yar oo ka badan dhexdhexaadka",
  "blurStrict0Short": "adag",
  "blurStrict1Short": "dhexdhexaad",
  "blurStrict2Short": "fudud",
  "blurStrictHelp": "Qof kasta oo barnaamijku aanu hubin inuu nin yahay waa la daboolaa. Adag wuxuu ka tagaa qiyaastii 7 nin 100-kii iyagoo aan la daboolin; dhexdhexaad qiyaastii 14, fudud qiyaastii 16. Heer kasta oo ka adkaan yar wuxuu sidoo kale ka tagaa qiyaastii 1 haweeney oo dheeraad ah 100-kii iyadoo aan la daboolin.",
  "stateOnNotMuted": "Codka asalka ah weli lama aamusiin, sidaas darteed waxaad maqlaysaa muusigga oo la socda codka la shaandheeyay. Dhammaystir habaynta hal mar ah ee hoose.",
  "stateOnMuteFailing": "Waaiya ma aamusiin karto codka asalka ah ee barnaamijka hadda shaqaynaya, sidaas darteed muusigga weli waa la maqli karaa. Jooji oo dib u bilow shaandhaynta. Haddii ay sii jirto, dir warbixinta baaritaanka (hoosta shaashaddan).",
  "stateTooSlow": "Taleefankani aad buu ugu gaabis yahay inuu shaandheeyo codka tooska ah, sidaas darteed codku wuu go'aa. “Fur link” ee hoose weli wuu shaqeeyaa: wuxuu shaandheeyaa muuqaalka ka hor inta aan la daarin.",
  "stateMonoNote": "Codku waa mono si taleefankani ula jaanqaado.",
  "stateBlockedSilenced": "Waa la aamusiiyay, maxaa yeelay ma oggola shaandhaynta: {apps}.",
  "stateBlockedUnfiltered": "Waxaa la daarayaa iyadoo aan la shaandheyn, maxaa yeelay ma oggola shaandhaynta: {apps}.",
  "stateCaptureFailed": "Android ma siin Waaiya codka barnaamijyada kale. Taabo badhanka si aad dib ugu bilowdo.",
  "stateCaptureCancelled": "Bilowga waa laga noqday markii Android ay weydiisay wadaagista shaashadda. Waaiya waxay u baahan tahay in halkaas la doorto Bilow (“Start”) si ay u hesho codka. Waxba lama duubo, waxna lama diro.",
  "startNoSetupTitle": "Muusigga weli waa la maqli doonaa",
  "startNoSetupBody": "Habaynta hal mar ah weli lama samayn. La'aanteed Waaiya ma aamusiin karto codka asalka ah: waxaad wada maqli doontaa muusigga iyo codka la shaandheeyay.\n\n“Fur link” wuu shaqeeyaa habayn la'aan.",
  "startNoSetupSetup": "Samee habaynta",
