  "setupGo": "U gudub habaynta",
  "helperTitle": "Taabasho ka gudubta daboollada",
  "helperBodyOff": "Caawin la'aan, daboolku wuxuu xannibaa taabashada ka hoosaysa. Caawiyaha Waaiya wuxuu u sawiraa daboollada si taabashadu uga gudubto. Daar “Wireless debugging” (Wi-Fi ayaa loo baahan yahay) oo taabo badhanka; markii ugu horreysay, hal mar isku xir sidii habaynta. Marka taleefanka dib loo shido, mar kale taabo.",
  "helperStart": "Bilow caawiyaha Waaiya",
  "helperOn": "Caawiyaha Waaiya ayaa sawira daboollada: taabashadu way ka gudubtaa. Wuu joogsadaa marka taleefanka dib loo shido ama marka “USB debugging” la damiyo; markaas mar kale taabo badhanka.",
