  "autostartTitle": "Bilow marka aad soo gasho",
  "autostartBody": "Shaandhee codka isla marka aad soo gasho kombiyuutarka.",
  "blurBodyDesktop": "Waxay daboolaysaa dadka iyo sawirrada shaashadda, daaqad kasta dusheeda, inta Waaiya furan tahay (way shaqaysaa haddii shaandhada codku daaran tahay iyo haddii kaleba). Kombiyuutarkan ayay ka shaqaysaa; meelna waxba looma diro. Xiridda daaqadda Waaiya waxay joojisaa qarinta.",
  "blurFailBodyDesktop": "Daaran: shaashadda oo dhan waa la daboolaa marka kombiyuutarku aad u gaabis yahay ama qarintu fashilanto; gujintu weli way gaartaa daaqadaha hoose. Damsan: shaashaddu way muuqanaysaa iyadoo xariiq casaan ahi ku jiro korka.",
  "blurStatusOnVisibleDesktop": "Qarintu way daaran tahay. Desktop-kani qarinta wuxuu ku muujiyaa sawir-qaadista shaashaddiisa, sidaas darteed meel la qariyay way qarsoonaanaysaa ilaa muuqaalku isbeddelo.",
  "blurStatusNoOverlayDesktop": "Qarintu kama muuqan karto daaqadaha kale dushooda desktop-kan. Faahfaahin:\n{details}",
  "blurStatusShareDialog": "Ka dooro shaashaddaada daaqadda wadaagista shaashadda oo ogolow. Waaiya hal mar oo kaliya ayay weydiisaa; sawirku kombiyuutarkan ayuu ku jiraa.",
  "blurStatusExited": "Qarintu si lama filaan ah ayay u joogsatay. Dami oo dib u daar doorasho qarin si aad mar kale isku daydo. Faahfaahin:\n{details}",
  "engineDetectorFailed": "Aaladda garata heesaha haweenka lama soo shubin, sidaas darteed codadka waa la aamusiiyaa inta doorashadaas daaran tahay.",
  "blurStatusUncovered": "Shaashad (monitor) kama daboolna qarinta: lalama wadaagin, ama goor dambe ayaa la galiyay. Dami oo dib u daar doorasho qarin, oo ka dooro shaashad kasta daaqadda wadaagista shaashadda.",
  "blurStatusModelsMissingDesktop": "Moodeelada qarintu kuma jiraan rakibaaddan, sidaas darteed waxba ma dabooli karto; xariiq casaan ah ayaa ku hadhaya korka shaashadda. Dib u rakib Waaiya.",
  "diagNoteDesktop": "Waxa Waaiya ku aragto kombiyuutarkan. Koobiyee oo sii qofka ku caawinaya. Barnaamijka laftiisu waxba ma diro.",
  "settingHoldSilenceBodyDesktop": "Waa lagu talinayaa. Haddii shaandhayntu iskeed u joogsato (khalad, adiga ma aha), barnaamijyada kale way aamusnaanayaan ilaa aad dib u bilowdo ama aad riixdo Jooji, halkii ay muusig aan la shaandheyn daari lahaayeen.",
  "settingStereoBodyDesktop": "Damsan: mono, oo kombiyuutarka ka qaata awood yar. Daaran: wuxuu kala ilaaliyaa dhinaca bidix iyo midig. Haddii kombiyuutarku aad ugu gaabis yahay stereo, iskiis ayuu ugu wareegaa mono.",
  "linkEntryBodyDesktop": "Dhaji link YouTube, TikTok ama Instagram si aad u daawato adigoo shaandhadu daaran tahay, ama si aad u kaydiso muusig la'aan.",
