  "fixBlurAppsBody": "Dabool ma jiro marka mid ka mid ah barnaamijyadan uu buuxiyo shaashadda, tusaale ahaan barnaamijka khariidadaha ama barnaamijka bangigaaga. Daboolladu way soo laabtaan isla marka aad ka baxdo, ama mar kasta oo Waaiya aysan hubin barnaamijka la muujinayo.",
  "fixBlurAppsNeedsSetup": "Waxay u baahan tahay habaynta hal mar ah: la'aanteed Waaiya ma garan karto barnaamijka shaashadda ku jira, sidaas darteed qarintu meel walba way ku sii jirtaa.",
  "fixBlurAppsHelperMode": "Caawiyaha Waaiya ma shaqaynayo, sidaas darteed barnaamijka shaashadda ku jira lama akhrin karo. Qarintu meel walba way ku sii jirtaa ilaa caawiyaha dib looga bilaabo bogga Habaynta.",
  "fixHandTitle": "Gacanta ku dabool meel",
  "fixHandBody": "Inta qarintu shaqaynayso, adigu waxaad dabooli kartaa qayb ka mid ah shaashadda, tusaale ahaan sawir ay qarintu seegtay: riix “Dabool meel” oo farta ku jiid dushiisa. Way daboolnaanaysaa ilaa aad ka saarto ama qarintu joogsato.",
  "fixHandNotRunning": "Waxaa la heli karaa inta qarintu shaqaynayso: shaandhayntu daaran tahay, ikhtiyaar qarin ahna daaran yahay.",
